{"sha": "964cd61a0c1036e02727602861ebca9472d900eaf59fd92e9d81418f1f3d726e", "body": ["\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:linmaps:9}", "假设 $\\lambda_0 x + \\lambda_1 u(x) + \\dots + \\lambda_{n-1}", "u^{n-1}(x) = 0$。作用 $u^{n-1}$：所有含因子 $u^{\\geq", "n}$ 的项皆消失，剩下 $\\lambda_0 u^{n-1}(x) = 0$，于是 $\\lambda_0 = 0$。", "对剩余关系式作用 $u^{n-2}$：$\\lambda_1 u^{n-1}(x) =", "0$，于是 $\\lambda_1 = 0$，依此类推。该族线性无关，且元素个数为", "$n = \\dim E$，故为基（见\\cref{prop:b1:findim:twoofthree}）。（在", "该基下，$u$ 表现为移位 --- 即极大幂零性的", "模型）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:linmaps:10}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 由 $f \\circ f = -\\mathrm{id}$ 知 $f$ 为双射，故", "        可逆（改编自\\cref{prop:b1:logic:comp}：$f$ 的双侧", "        逆为 $-f$）。若 $f(x) = \\lambda x$，$x \\neq 0$：", "        两边作用 $f$ 得 $-x = \\lambda^2 x$，故 $\\lambda^2 = -1$：", "        在 $\\R$ 中不可能。", "  \\item 逐步构造该族。取 $x_1 \\neq 0$：$(x_1,", "        f(x_1))$ 由 (1) 知线性无关。记 $\\operatorname{Vect}$ 为张成运算，", "        则当前族 $\\bigl(x_1, f(x_1), \\dots, x_k,", "        f(x_k)\\bigr)$ 的张成记为 $V_k$ --- 一个在 $f$ 下稳定的子空间", "        （每个生成元都映为另一生成元或其相反数：", "        $f(f(x_i)) = -x_i$）--- 若其不等于 $E$，取 $x_{k+1}", "        \\notin V_k$。\\emph{断言：扩充后的族线性无关。}", "        假设 $\\alpha x_{k+1} + \\beta f(x_{k+1}) + v = 0$，其中 $v", "        \\in V_k$ 且 $(\\alpha, \\beta) \\neq (0,0)$。作用 $f$ 得", "        $\\alpha f(x_{k+1}) - \\beta x_{k+1} + f(v) = 0$，其中 $f(v)", "        \\in V_k$。消去两关系式中的 $f(x_{k+1})$", "        （将第一式乘以 $\\alpha$，第二式乘以 $-\\beta$，", "        再相加）：", "        \\[", "        (\\alpha^2 + \\beta^2)\\, x_{k+1} \\in V_k ,", "        \\]", "        且 $\\alpha^2 + \\beta^2 \\neq 0$ 迫使 $x_{k+1} \\in V_k$：", "        矛盾。于是构造得以继续，", "        \\emph{每次添加两个向量}，直到 $V_k = E$。", "        此时最终的族是元素个数为偶数的基，故 $n$ 为偶数。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:linmaps:11}", "上界：对每个 $x$，$(u + v)(x) = u(x) + v(x) \\in", "\\operatorname{im} u + \\operatorname{im} v$，于是", "\\[", "\\operatorname{rk}(u + v)", "\\leq \\dim(\\operatorname{im} u + \\operatorname{im} v)", "\\leq \\operatorname{rk} u + \\operatorname{rk} v", "\\]", "（格拉斯曼，见\\cref{thm:b1:findim:grassmann}）。下界：", "对二元组 $(u + v, -v)$ 应用上界，其和为 $u$：", "\\[", "\\operatorname{rk} u \\leq \\operatorname{rk}(u + v) +", "\\operatorname{rk}(-v) = \\operatorname{rk}(u + v) +", "\\operatorname{rk} v,", "\\]", "由此 $\\operatorname{rk} u - \\operatorname{rk} v \\leq", "\\operatorname{rk}(u+v)$。交换 $u$ 与 $v$，即得绝对", "值形式的不等式。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:linmaps:12}", "\\emph{精确公式。}设 $v'$ 为 $v$ 在", "子空间 $\\operatorname{im} w$ 上的限制，其像为 $v(w(F)) =", "\\operatorname{im}(v \\circ w)$，其核为 $\\ker v \\cap", "\\operatorname{im} w$。对 $v'$ 在空间", "$\\operatorname{im} w$ 上应用秩--零化度定理：", "\\[", "\\operatorname{rk} w = \\dim\\operatorname{im} w", "= \\operatorname{rk}(v \\circ w) + \\dim(\\ker v \\cap", "\\operatorname{im} w) .", "\\]", "", "\\emph{弗罗贝尼乌斯。}对 $w$ 及", "$w \\circ u$ 各用一次精确公式：", "\\[", "\\operatorname{rk} w - \\operatorname{rk}(vw)", "= \\dim\\bigl(\\ker v \\cap \\operatorname{im} w\\bigr),", "\\qquad", "\\operatorname{rk}(wu) - \\operatorname{rk}(vwu)", "= \\dim\\bigl(\\ker v \\cap \\operatorname{im}(wu)\\bigr) .", "\\]", "由于 $\\operatorname{im}(w \\circ u) \\subseteq \\operatorname{im}", "w$，第二个交集包含于第一个，其", "维数不更大：", "\\[", "\\operatorname{rk}(wu) - \\operatorname{rk}(vwu)", "\\;\\leq\\; \\operatorname{rk} w - \\operatorname{rk}(vw) ,", "\\]", "移项即得弗罗贝尼乌斯不等式。取 $w =", "\\mathrm{id}_F$（秩为 $\\dim F$，且 $\\operatorname{im}\\,", "\\mathrm{id}_F = F$）：$\\operatorname{rk} v + \\operatorname{rk} u", "\\leq \\dim F + \\operatorname{rk}(vu)$，即西尔维斯特不等式 ---", "在矩阵形式下再次证明，见\\cref{exo:b1:matrices:10}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b1:linmaps:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $(\\mathrm{id} - p)^2 = \\mathrm{id} - 2p + p^2 =", "\\mathrm{id} - p$，故为投影。若 $y = x - p(x)$，则 $p(y) =", "p(x) - p^2(x) = 0$。反之，$x \\in \\ker p$ 给出 $x =", "(\\mathrm{id} - p)(x)$，于是 $\\operatorname{im}(\\mathrm{id} - p) = \\ker", "p$。又 $(\\mathrm{id} - p)(x) = 0 \\iff p(x) = x \\iff x \\in", "\\operatorname{im} p$（不动点，", "见\\cref{thm:b1:linmaps:projchar}）：$\\ker(\\mathrm{id} - p) =", "\\operatorname{im} p$。", "", "\\textbf{2.} $(\\lambda\\,\\mathrm{id} + \\mu p)^2 =", "\\lambda^2\\,\\mathrm{id} + (2\\lambda\\mu + \\mu^2)\\,p$。二元组", "$(\\mathrm{id}, p)$ 在 $\\mathcal{L}(E)$ 中线性无关：$p = c\\,", "\\mathrm{id}$ 则 $c^2 = c$，故 $p = 0$ 或 $\\mathrm{id}$，", "两者均被排除。比较系数，该映射为投影，当且仅当", "$\\lambda^2 = \\lambda$ 且 $2\\lambda\\mu + \\mu^2 = \\mu$。", "当 $\\lambda = 0$ 时：$\\mu \\in \\{0, 1\\}$。当 $\\lambda = 1$ 时：$\\mu^2 +", "\\mu = 0$，$\\mu \\in \\{0, -1\\}$。平面中恰有四个投影，", "它们是 $0$，$p$，$\\mathrm{id}$，$\\mathrm{id} - p$。", ""]}